IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa25-names-ch1`

-- coa25-tests-names-ch1.l4: tests for coa25-names-ch1.l4 (ss 1192 to 1199A).
-- Every expected value was decided by reading the section and written down before the run. The repeated shape of
-- the offence and penalty tests (ss 1193 to 1198B) is expanded from one template by work/build.py; the expected values
-- are those the text fixes for the shape, decided before any run.

-- The penalty these sections state, written out by hand from the text: "liable on summary conviction to a fine not
-- exceeding level 3 on the standard scale and, for continued contravention, a daily default fine not exceeding
-- one-tenth of level 3 on the standard scale".
`s 1193 test penalty level 3 with a tenth` MEANS
    Penalty WITH `how convicted` IS `on summary conviction`
                 `imprisonment not exceeding` IS NOTHING
                 `fine not exceeding` IS JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 1)
                 `daily default fine for continued contravention` IS JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 0.1)
                 `imprisonment and fine together` IS FALSE

-- ---- s 1192(1) (arguments: carrying on business in the United Kingdom; an express provision to the contrary applies)
#ASSERT `s 1192(1) this Chapter applies to the person` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1192(1) this Chapter applies to the person` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 1192(1) this Chapter applies to the person` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not carrying on business in the United Kingdom
#ASSERT `s 1192(1) this Chapter applies to the person` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- s 1192(3): the permitted additions (arguments: the kind of business; the addition)
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` `s 1192 an individual's forename or initial` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (a)
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 individuals carrying on business in partnership` `s 1192 an individual's forename or initial` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- (a) is for an individual
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 individuals carrying on business in partnership` `s 1192 the forenames of individual partners or the initials of those forenames` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (b)(i)
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` `s 1192 the forenames of individual partners or the initials of those forenames` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 individuals carrying on business in partnership` `s 1192 the addition of "s" at the end of a surname shared by two or more individual partners` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (b)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` `s 1192 the addition of "s" at the end of a surname shared by two or more individual partners` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` `s 1192 an addition merely indicating that the business is carried on in succession to a former owner of the business` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (c), either
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 individuals carrying on business in partnership` `s 1192 an addition merely indicating that the business is carried on in succession to a former owner of the business` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 another person carrying on business` `s 1192 an addition merely indicating that the business is carried on in succession to a former owner of the business` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` `s 1192 any other addition` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 individuals carrying on business in partnership` `s 1192 any other addition` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1192(3) the addition is a permitted addition` `s 1192 another person carrying on business` `s 1192 an individual's forename or initial` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- s 1192(2) (arguments: the kind of business; the name consists of the surname or surnames; the additions)
#ASSERT `s 1192(2) this Chapter prevents the business name` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` TRUE (LIST `s 1192 an individual's forename or initial`) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "do not prevent"
#ASSERT `s 1192(2) this Chapter prevents the business name` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` TRUE EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE -- no addition at all
#ASSERT `s 1192(2) this Chapter prevents the business name` `s 1192 individuals carrying on business in partnership` TRUE (LIST `s 1192 the forenames of individual partners or the initials of those forenames`, `s 1192 the addition of "s" at the end of a surname shared by two or more individual partners`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1192(2) this Chapter prevents the business name` `s 1192 individuals carrying on business in partnership` TRUE (LIST `s 1192 an addition merely indicating that the business is carried on in succession to a former owner of the business`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1192(2) this Chapter prevents the business name` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` TRUE (LIST `s 1192 an individual's forename or initial`, `s 1192 any other addition`) EQUALS NOTHING -- an addition other than a permitted addition
#ASSERT `s 1192(2) this Chapter prevents the business name` `s 1192 individuals carrying on business in partnership` TRUE (LIST `s 1192 an individual's forename or initial`) EQUALS NOTHING -- (a) is for an individual, not a partnership
#ASSERT `s 1192(2) this Chapter prevents the business name` `s 1192 an individual carrying on business` FALSE EMPTY EQUALS NOTHING -- not a name consisting of the surname
#ASSERT `s 1192(2) this Chapter prevents the business name` `s 1192 another person carrying on business` TRUE EMPTY EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- s 1193(1) (arguments: carries on business under the name; the body; likely to give the impression; approval given; the s 1199 answer; the s 1199A answer)
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` TRUE `s 1193 Her Majesty's Government, a part of the Scottish administration, the Welsh Assembly Government or Her Majesty's Government in Northern Ireland` TRUE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (a)
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` TRUE `s 1193 a local authority` TRUE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (b)
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` TRUE `s 1193 a public authority specified for the purposes of this section by regulations made by the Secretary of State` TRUE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (c)
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` TRUE `s 1193 a local authority` TRUE TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING -- with the approval of the Secretary of State
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` TRUE `s 1193 a local authority` FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING -- not likely to give the impression
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` TRUE `s 1193 no such body` TRUE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` FALSE `s 1193 a local authority` TRUE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING -- not carrying on business in the United Kingdom under the name
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` TRUE `s 1193 a local authority` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE -- s 1199: the sections do not apply
#ASSERT `s 1193(1) the person contravenes the prohibition on a name suggesting connection with government or a public authority` TRUE `s 1193 a local authority` TRUE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- s 1199A: a notice of the Secretary of State
-- ---- s 1193(2)
#ASSERT `s 1193(2) the body is a local authority` `s 1193 a local authority within the meaning of the Local Government Act 1972` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1193(2) the body is a local authority` `s 1193 the Common Council of the City of London` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1193(2) the body is a local authority` `s 1193 the Council of the Isles of Scilly` EQUALS JUST TRUE
